  spawn_chunk_radius 4 -> 1, initial_chunk_radius 4 -> 1, view_distance 10 (default) -> 3,
  tick_rate 20 (default) -> 10, motd "Welcome to Void Server!" -> "ATP configuration check",
  max_players 100 -> 7.

Apply at the repository root:   git apply tools/atp/patches/<this file>
Remove it after the test:       git apply -R tools/atp/patches/<this file>

